#EXTM3U
# QA fixture: source C, added through a URL that carries userinfo (docs/QA-SOURCES.md, sections 3 and 8).
#  - copy it into the harness fixture directory and add it as
#        http://qa-user:qa-secret@127.0.0.1:8765/qa-src-userinfo.m3u          -> source key 25b70358
