#    probe succeeds; the point of the fixture is that "qa-user" and "qa-secret" must never appear in any sink
#    (list row, footer, transient, notification, IPC status, `state show`, harness console, state dumps).
#    The list row and the label show the host only: 127.0.0.1. The edit field shows http://****@127.0.0.1:8765/qa-src-userinfo.m3u
#  - 3 channels in 1 group (Charlie); "Charlie Two" streams from a credentialed URL (second needle: cu / cs)
#  - the third entry has an empty title and a credentialed URL: the name must be "Channel 3", never the URL (D-QA-02 regression)
